# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Binary game assets are deliberately NOT tracked in git: they are gitignored and
# delivered by diffs\ (written by tools\generate_diffs.bat). No Git LFS filters are
# declared here - doing so would require every consumer to install git-lfs, and it
# would turn the maps and .vmt text definitions we do track into LFS pointers.

